@ClinicApi = https://localhost:7001

### Health/database check
GET {{ClinicApi}}/api/database-test

### Catalogs
GET {{ClinicApi}}/api/gender

###
GET {{ClinicApi}}/api/appointment-statuses

### Specialties
GET {{ClinicApi}}/api/specialties

###
POST {{ClinicApi}}/api/specialties
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Dermatology",
  "description": "Skin health"
}

### Consulting rooms
GET {{ClinicApi}}/api/consultingrooms

###
POST {{ClinicApi}}/api/consultingrooms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Room 3",
  "location": "Second floor"
}

### Doctors (replace specialty ids with ids from your database)
POST {{ClinicApi}}/api/doctors
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Elena",
  "lastName": "Santos",
  "professionalLicense": "LIC-2001",
  "phoneNumber": "555-3001",
  "email": "elena.santos@example.com",
  "specialtyIds": [1, 2]
}

### Appointments (replace all ids; dates must be in the future)
POST {{ClinicApi}}/api/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": 1,
  "doctorId": 1,
  "consultingRoomId": 1,
  "appointmentStatusId": 1,
  "startDateTime": "2030-08-05T09:00:00",
  "endDateTime": "2030-08-05T10:00:00",
  "notes": "First consultation"
}

### Appointment query filters
GET {{ClinicApi}}/api/appointments?from=2030-08-01T00:00:00&to=2030-08-31T23:59:59
